# Entrypoint for the space-on-failure cloud job (see [cloud] and
# [dependencies] in trilogy.toml). It runs only when refresh.preql finished
# `failed` on the same tick, and stands down as `skipped` otherwise — the same
# rule `trilogy run .` applies locally.
#
# The handler is on_failure.py: it opens (or bumps) a GitHub issue labelled
# `auto-fix`, which .github/workflows/auto-fix.yml answers with a fix PR. The
# issue link comes back as this run's `issue` output.
call `./on_failure.py`;
